~ start

if State.fishing_pole == "has":
	Tipman: So it gave you the fishing pole of the fishing poles, ahn!?
	Tipman: You can press "F" next to a water spot to start fishing
	Tipman: When hooking a fish, be ready to use your special bait to dodge the shots these crazy fishes can throw at you with your "Mouse"
	Tipman: Stand alert to shooting stars! you must press "Left Mouse Button" just right before it hits your bait
	Tipman: Doing this will parry the star back to the fish making it stun!
	Tipman: Do this enough to succesfully catch a fish!
	Tipman: Go have some fun in the waters!

elif State.fishing_pole == "" and !State.key_to_hut:
	Tipman: Hii! i am Tipman, you can call me Tip :#
	Tipman: Ooh, i see, its your first time around here
	Tipman: Go inside the hut over there, maybe the fisherman can help you
	Tipman: Here, the keys for you to enter
	set State.key_to_hut = true

elif State.fishing_pole == "" and State.key_to_hut:
	Tipman: Go talk to the fisherman inside the hut, maybe he can help you!


=> END

~ fishing_pole

if State.fishing_pole == "":
	Fisherman: Hey boy! looks like you dont have anything you can use for fun, eeygh
	Fisherman: Here, you can have this, go talk to Tip in case you get lost trying to use it
	set State.fishing_pole = "has"

elif State.fishing_pole == "has":
	Fisherman: Tip can help you if you stuck trying to figure out how to use this
	Fisherman: Now get out of my way, go have some fun on the waters!

=> END


~ door

Boy: Looks like i dont have the right key to it :(

=> END


~ fail_fish

Boy: Looking the water like this makes me feel so cozy

=> END